[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4992259113","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121452#issuecomment-4992259113","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121452","id":4992259113,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKY_UKQ","user":{"login":"VewDev","id":115565209,"node_id":"U_kgDOBuNimQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115565209?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev","html_url":"https://github.com/VewDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-16T13:11:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T13:12:36Z","body":"Latest version with this behavior is 4.7-dev3\n4.7-dev4 has the double quotes\n\nSeems to be a regression caused by 82f308d9571d87e6aac25d58630636cb159e6ae6 (#117710)\n\nWill try to make a fix today","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4992259113/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4992392075","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121452#issuecomment-4992392075","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121452","id":4992392075,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKZHbiw","user":{"login":"VewDev","id":115565209,"node_id":"U_kgDOBuNimQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115565209?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev","html_url":"https://github.com/VewDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-16T13:23:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T13:26:27Z","body":"This also happens for `@export_node_path` and I assume any other that uses\n```\noption.kind = ScriptLanguage::CODE_COMPLETION_KIND_CLASS;\n```\nIn #105081 it was stated by HolonProduction that:\n> I'd usually say we should quote all argument option preview strings for consistency, but in this case it makes sense to not do that, since the editor won't show the icons for quoted names.\n\nand then #117710 made by himself, when moving the autocomplete string insertion code to the server, this stopped working and was shown as double quoted, understandably because an external editor wouldn't show icons regardless.\n\n@HolonProduction, would the desired solution be to still display icons, even though the server responds with a double quote?\n\nIf so, which of these solutions should I make?\n- Just remove the `\"\"` in editor frontend code so its displayed properly. Definitely kinda hacky but also the simplest solution\n- Add a way for the editor to properly parse class names enclosed in double quotes (maybe just based on them having `option.kind = class`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4992392075/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4992454015","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121452#issuecomment-4992454015","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121452","id":4992454015,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKZLNfw","user":{"login":"VewDev","id":115565209,"node_id":"U_kgDOBuNimQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115565209?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev","html_url":"https://github.com/VewDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VewDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-16T13:28:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-16T13:28:57Z","body":"Terrible bad timing, I see this has been assigned to Holon right as I clicked that send button, I guess that means I shouldn't keep looking into this nor work on a PR?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godo